e testee and the Dockerized pinned suite, waits for the READY barrier, runs harness.py per role, collects results/, and shuts both sides down. Usage: bb autobahn:jolt <role> <agent>\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n   :task (apply shell {:continue true} \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"bash\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"tools/jolt-autobahn/launch.sh\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" *command-line-args*)}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n  deps:npm\\\\\\\\n  {:doc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Worktree-local npm ci, reused only while input and installed-file digests match\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n   :task (shell \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"bb\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"src/dev/build_cache.clj\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"npm\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n  ;; jolt host lane (experimental, docs/design/yin.repl-jolt-implementation.md)\\\\\\\\n  bootstrap:jolt\\\\\\\\n  {:doc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Materialize the jolt-toolchain.edn pins into build/tools/jolt (mise Chez/CMake checked, jolt cloned at the full SHA, never pulled) and write build/tools/jolt-env.sh\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n   :task (System/exit\\\\\\\\n           (:exit (shell {:continue true} \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"bb\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"src/dev/jolt_bootstrap.clj\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")))}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n  test:jolt-bootstrap-neg\\\\\\\\n  {:doc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Copy/revert the jolt clone under gitignored build/bootstrap-neg (deleted on success, retained on failure) and declare a synthetic patch and prove bootstrap refuses it unapplied or corrupted, then accepts it applied (JOLT_BOOTSTRAP_TEST_DIR selects the source clone)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n   :task (System/exit\\\\\\\\n           (:exit (shell {:continue true} \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"bb\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"src/dev/jolt_bootstrap.clj\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"--test-negative\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\")))}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\n  smoke:jolt\\\\\\\\n  {:doc \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"J0a baseline smoke under jolt -Srepro -M:jolt: tracked load of yang.antlr.export/packet and defcfn :blocking calls (needs bb bootstrap:jolt)\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"\\\\\\\\n  